ConfirmUninstall=Kei te tino hiahia koe ki te tango katoa i a %1 me ōna wāhanga katoa?
UninstallOnlyOnWin64=Ka taea anake te tango i tēnei tāutanga i runga i te Windows 64-bit.
OnlyAdminCanUninstall=Ka taea anake te tango i tēnei tāutanga e tētahi kaiwhakamahi whai mana whakahaere.
UninstallStatusLabel=Tēnā tatari i a %1 e tangohia ana i tō rorohiko.
UninstalledAll=I tangohia pai a %1 i tō rorohiko.
UninstalledMost=Kua oti te tango a %1.%n%nKāore i taea te tango i ētahi huānga. Ka taea te tango ā-ringa i ēnei.
UninstalledAndNeedsRestart=Hei whakaoti i te tangohanga o %1, me tīmata anō tō rorohiko.%n%nKei te hiahia koe ki te tīmata anō ināianei?
UninstallDataCorrupted=Kua kino te kōnae "%1". Kāore e taea te tango
ConfirmDeleteSharedFileTitle=Tangohia te Kōnae Tiritahi?
ConfirmDeleteSharedFile2=E tohu ana te pūnaha kāore te kōnae tiritahi e whai ake nei i te whakamahia e ētahi hōtaka. Kei te hiahia koe kia tangohia e te Pūtangotango tēnei kōnae tiritahi?%n%nKi te kei te whakamahi tonu ētahi hōtaka i tēnei kōnae ka tangohia, kāore pea aua hōtaka e mahi tika. Ki te kāore koe i te tino mōhio, tīpakohia te Kāore. Kāore he kino ka puta ki te waiho i te kōnae ki tō pūnaha.
SharedFileNameLabel=Ingoa kōnae:
SharedFileLocationLabel=Wāhi:
